    <string name="manual_title">Pantser User Manual</string>
    <string name="manual_welcome">Welcome to Pantser, the premium, zero-maintenance label generator designed specifically for apparel size printing on US Letter pages.</string>
    <string name="manual_concept_title">Core Concept: Dimension Identity &amp; Reuse</string>
    <string name="manual_concept_body">Pantser eliminates file clutter entirely. When you generate a print dimension like \'32 x 30\', the app treats those dimensions as a unique identity. Instead of creating a new file every time, it intelligently checks for an existing file matching that exact size configuration, instantly reusing it.</string>
    <string name="manual_steps_title">Step-by-Step Instructions</string>
    <string name="manual_steps_body">1. Enter Dimensions: Click the input field and type your size (e.g., \'34 x 32\' or \'M\').\n\n2. Click Create: Press \'CREATE LABEL\'. The app builds a high-resolution grid PDF or opens the existing one immediately.\n\n3. System Print: The Android system print dialogue will open automatically.\n\n4. Quick print: Once printed, it appears in your \'Quick print\' tray for one-tap generation.</string>
    <string name="manual_settings_title">Settings Guide</string>
    <string name="manual_settings_body">• Theme Mode: Switch between System Default, Dark Mode, and Light Mode.\n\n• Theme Palette: Choose from custom blended themes like Ember Night, Lavender Cream, or Spring Pastel.\n\n• Paper Layout: Configure the grid columns and rows.\n\n• Export &amp; Cleanup: Extract PDFs to downloads or manage storage via cache/old file removal.</string>

